          "explanation": "The doctor asked targeted questions to uncover current severity beyond the opening summary.",
          "quote": "我先问4个关键问题"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00028",
          "explanation": "The family then supplied additional severity details including trismus and ocular discomfort.",
          "quote": "眼睛转动的时候她说有点扯着不舒服"
