          "explanation": "The doctor avoided overcalling catastrophe from limited data.",
          "quote": "不等于已经失控"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
          "explanation": "The doctor directed verification through CT, exam, and specialist assessment.",
          "quote": "还得结合：**CT有没有明确脓肿"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was completed: the doctor did not let absence of dramatic systemic signs reassure falsely, but also avoided diagnosing sepsis/orbital infection online and consistently routed the uncertainty to CT, labs, examination, and oral-maxillofacial review.",
