          "explanation": "The doctor escalated to emergency calling for specified worsening or inability to execute transport.",
          "quote": "那就**直接打120**"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was completed because the doctor dynamically upgraded from same-day urgent evaluation to immediate departure and 120/urgent nurse escalation when refusal, eye involvement, airway/swallowing, systemic, or rapid-spread risks were present.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
