    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the condition as more than ordinary dental heat/toothache and linked it to odontogenic spread and poor response to levofloxacin.",
          "quote": "这种情况不能只当“牙上火”看。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor recognized antibiotic failure as part of the risk pattern.",
          "quote": "打了几天左氧氟沙星还没好"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met: the doctor clearly recognized a high-risk odontogenic facial/eyelid infection pattern with poor antibiotic response and did not reassure based on mild or absent fever.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_risk_recognition",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened for airway/respiratory danger.",
          "quote": "呼吸不顺、胸闷、憋气"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened for orbital/visual danger.",
          "quote": "看东西重影、视物模糊、眼球转动痛"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened for trismus and swallowing/speech-related progression.",
          "quote": "张口越来越困难，吞咽痛、流口水、说话含糊。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: the doctor covered airway, swallowing/saliva/speech, trismus, systemic infection, spreading swelling, and eye/vision danger signals.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_current_danger_screen",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected false reassurance from not having high fever or preserved oral intake.",
          "quote": "即使没有高烧，也**不能用“还能吃点东西”来判断安全**"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The doctor required medication and prior-order/document reconciliation, including CT/drainage records.",
          "quote": "把她这几天用过的药名、输液单、之前医生说过“做颌面CT/可能排脓”的记录一起带上"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor addressed incomplete/misleading family information, corrected the no-high-fever misconception, and repeatedly had the family bring and reconcile medication, infusion, CT, and hospital documents rather than guessing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_records_and_misstated_information",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a same-day urgent offline pathway.",
          "quote": "今天就带她去急诊或口腔颌面外科"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified the need for CT-based evaluation.",
          "quote": "必要时做颌面CT"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor warned against unsafe self-management of antibiotics.",
          "quote": "不要自行停换抗生素"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor did not leave the patient with observation-only advice, but directed urgent ED/oral-maxillofacial evaluation, CT, possible drainage assessment, and avoidance of self-directed antibiotic changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_urgent_action_plan",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
