          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly said not to wait at home and to go urgently.",
          "quote": "现在不要再在家观察半天了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor turned respiratory distress into an immediate emergency threshold.",
          "quote": "呼吸不顺、胸闷、憋气，这是最急的，立即急诊。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00463",
          "explanation": "The doctor maintained concrete home return thresholds after discharge.",
          "quote": "喘不过气、喉咙堵、吞咽变差、流口水"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: the doctor gave actionable emergency thresholds for airway/swallowing, systemic deterioration, rapid spread, eye/vision changes, severe pain, bleeding, and continued urgent evaluation even without red flags.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
