      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00189",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed fear of surgery/anesthesia without overpromising.",
          "quote": "现在不是默认一定大手术，也不是默认一定全麻"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00252",
          "explanation": "The doctor prompted the family to disclose and clarify antihypertensive medication around procedural planning.",
          "quote": "她现在常吃的降压药今天怎么安排？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00400",
          "explanation": "The doctor required discharge medication and follow-up reconciliation before home execution.",
          "quote": "抗感染药：药名、一次几片、一天几次、共几天"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met: the doctor handled refusal and anesthesia/drainage fear, instructed the family to organize medication and relevant chronic-medication information, and closed multiple transitions by confirming transport, admission, inpatient monitoring, discharge questions, prescriptions, and follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_execution_and_closure",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
